WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.261 --> 00:00:15.270
It was the first day of summer camp.

2
00:00:16.651 --> 00:00:19.453
Ivy was not happy as she rode in her family's van.

3
00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:24.396
She drew a picture in her sketch pad, trying to imagine Camp Evergreen.

4
00:00:25.097 --> 00:00:26.658
She sketched an ugly building.

5
00:00:27.398 --> 00:00:29.400
Around it was a high electric fence.

6
00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:32.770
A sign on the front said Evergreen Prison.

7
00:00:35.753 --> 00:00:38.095
She drew counselors who looked like zombie guards.

8
00:00:39.496 --> 00:00:41.378
All the campers wore prison outfits.

9
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.942
Ivy was supposed to go to Camp Kahlo, an art camp.

10
00:00:47.523 --> 00:00:48.924
But Camp Kahlo was full.

11
00:00:50.265 --> 00:00:53.047
So her parents signed her up for Camp Evergreen instead.

12
00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:56.650
"There's the camp sign!"

13
00:00:57.011 --> 00:00:58.372
Dad called from the front seat.

14
00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.461
"You'll have such a great time here!"

15
00:01:01.941 --> 00:01:02.481
Mom said.

16
00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:05.482
"There are so many fun outdoor activities."

17
00:01:07.182 --> 00:01:08.503
Ivy slid down in the seat.

18
00:01:08.523 --> 00:01:12.024
"I hate the outdoors, remember?"

19
00:01:12.044 --> 00:01:17.325
"Don't be silly—you love the outdoors," Mom said.

20
00:01:17.345 --> 00:01:19.806
"Remember our picnic last summer?

21
00:01:20.786 --> 00:01:23.367
You skipped through the meadow, picking wildflowers."

22
00:01:23.387 --> 00:01:31.951
"No, I tripped over a tree root and got stung by a wasp," Ivy said.

23
00:01:31.971 --> 00:01:35.933
"We're here!"

24
00:01:36.493 --> 00:01:39.475
Dad said cheerfully as the van pulled into a parking lot.

25
00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:46.078
Suddenly the door on Ivy's side of the van opened.

26
00:01:46.638 --> 00:01:49.220
A woman wearing an army cap poked her head inside.

27
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.741
A whistle hung from a string around her neck.

28
00:01:51.761 --> 00:01:54.002
"Greetings, camper!

29
00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:55.543
Private Nelson here!"

30
00:01:56.004 --> 00:01:56.564
she shouted.

31
00:01:57.964 --> 00:02:01.066
"Yikes!" Ivy thought, climbing out of the van.

32
00:02:01.086 --> 00:02:05.209
"She looks just like the zombie guards in my drawing!"

33
00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:12.174
All around them, kids and parents carried suitcases, duffels, and sleeping bags.

34
00:02:13.094 --> 00:02:16.637
Dad tried to shake hands with Private, but she saluted him instead.

35
00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:26.643
is Ivy's first summer at camp, so she's very excited!"

36
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:27.644
Mom said.

37
00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:29.749
Ivy rolled her eyes.

38
00:02:30.949 --> 00:02:33.750
Private crossed her arms and looked Ivy up and down.

39
00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:37.252
"I'm in charge of all sports.

40
00:02:37.992 --> 00:02:41.173
Soccer, baseball, tennis, swimming, canoeing.

41
00:02:41.894 --> 00:02:43.394
What's your favorite sport?"

42
00:02:47.736 --> 00:02:48.276
Ivy said.

43
00:02:48.296 --> 00:02:50.357
"I also like painting."

44
00:02:50.377 --> 00:02:56.820
"Hmm, we do have arts and crafts twice a week," Private said.

45
00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.381
"And when it rains.

46
00:02:58.981 --> 00:03:00.242
If you like that kind of thing."

47
00:03:03.225 --> 00:03:04.986
Ivy's parents unloaded her stuff.

48
00:03:06.027 --> 00:03:07.268
Private blew her whistle.

49
00:03:07.608 --> 00:03:09.690
The shrill noise made everyone jump.

50
00:03:10.231 --> 00:03:13.233
A young woman wearing a Camp Evergreen T-shirt came running.

51
00:03:13.253 --> 00:03:16.936
"Hi, Ivy!

52
00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:18.978
I'm Penelope, one of the camp counselors!

53
00:03:19.518 --> 00:03:20.499
I'll bring you to your cabin."

54
00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.381
Ivy's parents hugged her good-bye.

55
00:03:23.401 --> 00:03:25.243
"Send lots of letters!"

56
00:03:25.643 --> 00:03:26.204
Dad said.

57
00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.502
"Have a great summer, sweetheart!"

58
00:03:28.882 --> 00:03:29.442
Mom said.

59
00:03:29.462 --> 00:03:31.244
"Yeah, right."

60
00:03:32.325 --> 00:03:33.105
Ivy moaned.

61
00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:36.929
"This place is worse than prison."

62
00:03:39.851 --> 00:03:42.814
She gave her parents a sad wave as the van drove away.

63
00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:49.019
"Camp Evergreen is the absolute best summer camp in the world!"

64
00:03:49.459 --> 00:03:52.562
Penelope gushed as she and Ivy walked across the parking lot.

65
00:03:52.582 --> 00:03:54.944
"I've been coming here since I was six.

66
00:03:55.836 --> 00:03:57.518
I'm full of Evergreen spirit!"

67
00:03:57.538 --> 00:04:00.040
"Evergreen spirit?"

68
00:04:00.701 --> 00:04:01.241
Ivy thought.

69
00:04:01.261 --> 00:04:03.343
"What the heck is that?"

70
00:04:05.585 --> 00:04:08.287
Penelope showed her a large building called the lodge.

71
00:04:09.628 --> 00:04:11.230
"The mess hall and kitchen are in here.

72
00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.392
The food is sooo yummy!"

73
00:04:17.515 --> 00:04:22.400
smells like dirty socks," Ivy muttered.

74
00:04:24.388 --> 00:04:30.010
Next Penelope pointed out the activity rooms and the square, a wide, grassy outdoor area.

75
00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:32.730
"That path leads to the sports area.

76
00:04:34.151 --> 00:04:36.591
There are tennis courts and soccer and baseball fields.

77
00:04:37.432 --> 00:04:39.792
The girls' cabins are this way," Penelope said.

78
00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.873
"But first I'll show you the showers."

79
00:04:42.933 --> 00:04:45.074
They approached an old, rundown building.

80
00:04:47.274 --> 00:04:49.035
Penelope showed Ivy the showers.

81
00:04:50.655 --> 00:04:52.996
Ivy peered into the dark, damp stalls.

82
00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.942
The paint was peeling, and the floors looked green and slimy.

83
00:04:56.962 --> 00:05:03.286
"There's somebody in this shower," Ivy said with a shudder.

84
00:05:03.306 --> 00:05:06.748
"Somebody with eight creepy legs!"
